Z||000026||pontiacs4me||08-30-2001||01:57 AM||||Look for a 1994-1998 saleen S351 style wing, the shape is almost like that of a stock fiero gt wing, but the trailing edge curves up more, and wraps around to the pointing edges.  I saw one tonight at the local carwash, and compared it to mine.  I think it would look great.  I found a pic, but it isnt very good, just search around the net, and I bet you can find a better pic than me.<BR> <A HREF="http://speedworx.com/cgi-local/shop.pl/SID=999150446.931/page=product.html/product=1144" TARGET=_blank>http://speedworx.com/cgi-local/shop.pl/SID=999150446.931/page=product.html/product=1144</A> ||||reg||1
